 "manufacturer": "Texas Instruments",
 "title": "Dual audio operational amplifier (RC4580)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "SLOS412E, revised November 2024",
  "pages": 32
 },
 "summary": "Two bipolar op amps in one 8-pin package, aimed at audio work: preamplifiers, active filters, headphone drivers and measurement gear. At ±15 V a typical amplifier has 12 MHz gain-bandwidth, 5 V/µs slew, 0.0005 % THD and 0.8 µVrms RIAA-weighted noise. It runs from ±2 V to ±16 V (±18 V absolute) over -40 °C to 125 °C, and shares its pinout with the NJM4580, LM833, NE5532 and NJM4558/9 and NJM4560/2/5.",
 "key_figures": [
