    "Design targets: 15V supply, 12V reference, 2V to 10V input, ±8V differential output.",
    "For a low-noise system the four resistors can drop to 6 kΩ or less, so their noise stays below the amplifier's.",
    "With 12 MHz of bandwidth, the circuit handles signals below 12 MHz.",
    "The output range is held to 2 V to 10 V for linearity; the measured transfer curves sweep VIN from 0 V to 12 V."
